---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro'
---

<Page title="Jesse Gerlach | Non Fiction Form">
  <main class="p-4 lg:max-w-3xl lg:mx-auto">
    <p class="text-2xl">Huzzah!</p>
    <p class="text-xl">
      Your book is now this much closer to reaching your hands! I truly cannot
      wait to collaborate with you.
    </p>
    <p class="text-xl">
      I will reach out within 3 business days to confirm our meeting time and
      format. Your book will be completed before you know it!
    </p>
    <p class="text-xl">
      In the meantime, if you have any documents you’d like to share, go ahead
      and gather them. They do not need to be organized prior to our first
      meeting. I’ll help with all of that. Even if all you have is on a stained
      napkin, get that ready. We’ll hit the ground running and see your dream
      book fully realized in no time! Until then!
    </p>

    <p class="text-xl mb-24">
      Blessings,
      <br /> Jesse
    </p>

    <div class="text-center">
      <a href="/" class="btn">
        Back to home page.
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Page>
